{"version":"1.1","updated":"2026-10-21","requirements":[
  {"id":"US-01","type":"functional","statement":"As a Customer, I want to create and maintain my personal profile with name, address, phone number, and an optional bank account, so that the system can identify me and optionally store my payment details.","acceptance_criteria":[
    {"id":"US-01-AC01","format":"given_when_then","text":"Given a logged-in Customer, when they submit a profile containing name, address, and phone number (bank account optional), then the system stores the profile."},
    {"id":"US-01-AC02","format":"condition","text":"The system rejects the profile creation if any mandatory attribute (name, address, phone) is missing."},
    {"id":"US-01-AC03","format":"condition","text":"The bank account attribute may be null; all other attributes must be non-null."}
  ]},
  {"id":"US-02","type":"functional","statement":"As an OrderStaff, I want to create and maintain product records with name, description, price, and image, so that customers can browse and order the correct items.","acceptance_criteria":[
    {"id":"US-02-AC01","format":"given_when_then","text":"Given an OrderStaff, when they submit a product with name, description, price, and image, then the product is stored."},
    {"id":"US-02-AC02","format":"condition","text":"The system rejects the product if any mandatory attribute is missing."},
    {"id":"US-02-AC03","format":"condition","text":"The price attribute is stored as a decimal number."}
  ]},
  {"id":"US-03","type":"functional","statement":"As a Customer, I want to submit an order that references existing products, includes quantities and unit prices, and specifies a payment method, so that the order can be processed by the business.","acceptance_criteria":[
    {"id":"US-03-AC01","format":"given_when_then","text":"Given a known Customer, when they submit an order containing at least one order item that references an existing product, then the system creates the order with status submitted and records the submission date."},
    {"id":"US-03-AC02","format":"given_when_then","text":"Given an unknown Customer, when they attempt to submit an order, then the system rejects the submission and no order is created."},
    {"id":"US-03-AC03","format":"given_when_then","text":"Given an order with no order items, when it is submitted, then the system rejects the submission and no order is created."},
    {"id":"US-03-AC04","format":"given_when_then","text":"Given an order item that references a non-existent product, when the order is submitted, then the system rejects the submission and no order is created."},
    {"id":"US-03-AC05","format":"condition","text":"The total amount of the order equals the sum of quantity × unit price for all its order items."},
    {"id":"US-03-AC06","format":"condition","text":"The order status may only be one of submitted, pending, filled, shipped, closed."},
    {"id":"US-03-AC07","format":"condition","text":"The payment method recorded on the order is limited to bank, card, cash."}
  ]},
  {"id":"US-04","type":"functional","statement":"As an OrderStaff, I want to receive a submitted order, so that it moves to the pending state and can be processed further.","acceptance_criteria":[
    {"id":"US-04-AC01","format":"given_when_then","text":"Given an Order in status submitted, when OrderStaff invokes receive, then the order status changes to pending."},
    {"id":"US-04-AC02","format":"given_when_then","text":"Given an Order whose status is not submitted, when OrderStaff invokes receive, then the system rejects the operation and the status remains unchanged."},
    {"id":"US-04-AC03","format":"condition","text":"The status transition submitted → pending is the only allowed transition for this action."}
  ]},
  {"id":"US-05","type":"functional","statement":"As an OrderStaff, I want to mark a pending order as filled, so that it can be prepared for shipping.","acceptance_criteria":[
    {"id":"US-05-AC01","format":"given_when_then","text":"Given an Order in status pending, when OrderStaff marks it as filled, then the status becomes filled."},
    {"id":"US-05-AC02","format":"given_when_then","text":"Given an Order not in pending status, when OrderStaff attempts to mark it as filled, then the operation is rejected and the status stays unchanged."},
    {"id":"US-05-AC03","format":"condition","text":"The status transition pending → filled is allowed; no other transition is permitted by this action."}
  ]},
  {"id":"US-06","type":"functional","statement":"As an OrderStaff, I want to decline a pending order, so that it is closed without further processing.","acceptance_criteria":[
    {"id":"US-06-AC01","format":"given_when_then","text":"Given an Order in status pending, when OrderStaff declines it, then the status changes to closed."},
    {"id":"US-06-AC02","format":"given_when_then","text":"Given an Order not in pending status, when OrderStaff attempts to decline it, then the operation is rejected and the status remains unchanged."},
    {"id":"US-06-AC03","format":"condition","text":"The status transition pending → closed is allowed only via the decline action."}
  ]},
  {"id":"US-07","type":"functional","statement":"As an OrderStaff, I want to ship a filled order, so that the customer receives the goods.","acceptance_criteria":[
    {"id":"US-07-AC01","format":"given_when_then","text":"Given an Order in status filled, when OrderStaff sets it to shipped, then the status becomes shipped."},
    {"id":"US-07-AC02","format":"given_when_then","text":"Given an Order not in filled status, when OrderStaff attempts to set it to shipped, then the operation is rejected and the status stays unchanged."},
    {"id":"US-07-AC03","format":"condition","text":"The status transition filled → shipped is the only allowed transition for shipping."}
  ]},
  {"id":"US-08","type":"functional","statement":"As an Accountant, I want to raise an invoice for a filled or shipped order that has no existing invoice, so that the order can be billed.","acceptance_criteria":[
    {"id":"US-08-AC01","format":"given_when_then","text":"Given an Order in status filled or shipped without an invoice, when Accountant creates an invoice with date, amount, payment method, and status issued, then the invoice is stored and linked to the order."},
    {"id":"US-08-AC02","format":"given_when_then","text":"Given an Order that already has an invoice, when Accountant attempts to raise another invoice, then the system rejects the request."},
    {"id":"US-08-AC03","format":"given_when_then","text":"Given an Order whose status is submitted, pending, or closed, when Accountant attempts to raise an invoice, then the request is rejected."},
    {"id":"US-08-AC04","format":"condition","text":"The invoice status may only be issued or paid."},
    {"id":"US-08-AC05","format":"condition","text":"The payment method on the invoice is limited to bank, card, cash."}
  ]},
  {"id":"US-09","type":"functional","statement":"As a Customer, I want to submit a payment against an issued invoice, so that the invoice can be settled.","acceptance_criteria":[
    {"id":"US-09-AC01","format":"given_when_then","text":"Given an Invoice in status issued, when the Customer submits a payment with date, amount, and payment method, then the payment is recorded with status pending."},
    {"id":"US-09-AC02","format":"given_when_then","text":"Given an Invoice in status paid, when the Customer attempts to submit a payment, then the system rejects the submission."},
    {"id":"US-09-AC03","format":"given_when_then","text":"Given a previously failed payment on an invoice, when the Customer submits a new payment, then the new payment is recorded as pending while the failed one remains failed."},
    {"id":"US-09-AC04","format":"condition","text":"The payment method is limited to bank, card, cash."},
    {"id":"US-09-AC05","format":"condition","text":"The payment amount is stored as a decimal number."}
  ]},
  {"id":"US-10","type":"functional","statement":"As an Accountant, I want to confirm or reject pending payments, so that the invoice and order statuses reflect the true financial state.","acceptance_criteria":[
    {"id":"US-10-AC01","format":"given_when_then","text":"Given a Payment in status pending, when Accountant confirms it, then the payment status becomes completed and the related Invoice status changes to paid."},
    {"id":"US-10-AC02","format":"given_when_then","text":"Given a Payment in status pending, when Accountant rejects it, then the payment status becomes failed and the Invoice and Order statuses remain unchanged."},
    {"id":"US-10-AC03","format":"given_when_then","text":"Given a Payment whose status is not pending, when Accountant attempts to confirm or reject it, then the operation is rejected and the status stays unchanged."},
    {"id":"US-10-AC04","format":"condition","text":"The payment status may only transition from pending to completed or failed."},
    {"id":"US-10-AC05","format":"condition","text":"The invoice status may only transition from issued to paid."}
  ]},
  {"id":"US-11","type":"functional","statement":"As an OrderStaff, I want to close a shipped order whose invoice is paid, so that the order lifecycle ends.","acceptance_criteria":[
    {"id":"US-11-AC01","format":"given_when_then","text":"Given an Order in status shipped whose linked Invoice is in status paid, when OrderStaff closes the order, then the order status becomes closed."},
    {"id":"US-11-AC02","format":"given_when_then","text":"Given a shipped order whose invoice is not paid, when OrderStaff attempts to close it, then the operation is rejected and the status remains shipped."},
    {"id":"US-11-AC03","format":"given_when_then","text":"Given an order whose invoice is paid but whose status is not shipped, when OrderStaff attempts to close it, then the operation is rejected."},
    {"id":"US-11-AC04","format":"condition","text":"An order whose status is closed cannot have its status changed thereafter."},
    {"id":"US-11-AC05","format":"condition","text":"The system records the timestamp and user for every status change (audit requirement)."}
  ]},
  {"id":"NFR-01","type":"performance","statement":"When a user submits an order containing up to 50 order items under normal operating conditions, the system shall register the order and respond within 2 seconds for at least 95% of submissions.","acceptance_criteria":[]},
  {"id":"NFR-02","type":"performance","statement":"Under normal operating conditions, the system shall support at least 200 concurrent users and at least 20 order submissions per second while meeting the response time of NFR-01.","acceptance_criteria":[]},
  {"id":"NFR-03","type":"security","statement":"The system shall authenticate every user before granting access to any customer, order, invoice or payment data, and shall reject 100% of unauthenticated requests.","acceptance_criteria":[]},
  {"id":"NFR-04","type":"security","statement":"The system shall allow only users holding the accountant role to confirm or reject a payment, and shall reject the same request from any other user.","acceptance_criteria":[]},
  {"id":"NFR-05","type":"security","statement":"The system shall protect customer personal data and bank account numbers by encrypting them in transit with TLS 1.2 or higher and at rest.","acceptance_criteria":[]},
  {"id":"NFR-06","type":"security","statement":"The system shall record the user and the time of every status change of an order, an invoice and a payment, and shall retain these records for at least 12 months.","acceptance_criteria":[]},
  {"id":"NFR-07","type":"availability","statement":"The system shall be available for at least 99.5% of each calendar month, excluding scheduled maintenance announced at least 24 hours in advance.","acceptance_criteria":[]},
  {"id":"NFR-08","type":"availability","statement":"When a server failure occurs, the system shall resume accepting requests within 15 minutes without losing any order, invoice or payment recorded before the failure.","acceptance_criteria":[]}
]}

