        {"id": "US-05-AC02", "format": "given_when_then", "text": "Given a pending order, when OrderStaff selects “fill”, then the order status becomes filled (REQ-F-20)."},
        {"id": "US-05-AC03", "format": "given_when_then", "text": "Given an order whose status is not pending, when OrderStaff attempts to fill it, then the request is rejected and the status stays unchanged (REQ-F-21)."}
